# Matt Pocock Skills (Cursor)

## Where the skill content lives

- Canonical skill instructions are vendored under `skills/**/SKILL.md`
- Cursor entry points (invoke by skill name) are under `.cursor/skills/**/SKILL.md`

## Setup dependency (issue tracker + domain docs)

Some engineering skills assume per-repo config in `docs/agents/`:

- `docs/agents/issue-tracker.md`
- `docs/agents/triage-labels.md`
- `docs/agents/domain.md`

If any of those are missing and the user asks to run `triage`, `to-issues`, or `to-prd`, run `setup-matt-pocock-skills` first.

## Domain language + decisions

Prefer using (and updating) these docs as you work:

- `CONTEXT.md` (domain glossary + jargon)
- `docs/adr/` (architectural decisions)
